{
 "title": "文本和字符",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "双引号中的文本是**字符串**（`str`）：对 UTF-8 内存的不可变视图，所以可以包含任何语言的文字。单引号中的 `'A'` 是单个字符，它的值是 ASCII 数字（`u8`）。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    greeting = \"Hello\"",
    "    letter = 'A'",
    "    print(greeting, letter)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Hello 65"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "特殊字符用 `\\` 书写：`\\n` 换行，`\\t` 制表符，`\\\\` 反斜杠，`\\\"` 双引号。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"First\\nSecond\")",
    "    print(\"Name:\\tAli\")",
    "    print(\"He said \\\"hello\\\"\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "First",
    "Second",
    "Name:\tAli",
    "He said \"hello\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c01-l04-x1",
   "prompt": "只用一个 `print` 输出两行：`One` 和 `Two`。（使用 `\\n`）",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"Bir İki\")"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    print(\"One\\nTwo\")"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `\\n` 放在空格的位置。",
   "expected": [
    "One",
    "Two"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c01-l04-q1",
   "q": "`'A'` 和 `\"A\"` 是同一个东西吗？",
   "options": [
    "是",
    "不是：一个是字符，另一个是字符串",
    "不是：其中一个是错误"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "单引号产生字符（一个数字），双引号产生字符串。"
  }
 ]
}
